<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>API Documentation</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Unggah file ke Kaminoa Uploader lewat API</p>

        <h2>Endpoint</h2>
        <div class="endpoint"><span class="method">POST</span><%= apiUrl %></div>
        <p>Kirim request dengan <code>Content-Type: multipart/form-data</code>.</p>

        <h2>Parameter</h2>
        <p>Semua file bersifat sementara dan dihapus otomatis dalam 1 jam.</p>
        <table>
            <tr><th>Field</th><th>Tipe</th><th>Wajib</th><th>Keterangan</th></tr>
            <tr><td><code>file</code></td><td>file</td><td>Ya</td><td>File yang ingin diunggah (maks. 50MB).</td></tr>
        </table>

        <h2>Contoh — cURL</h2>
        <pre><code>curl -X POST <%= apiUrl %> \
  -F "file=@/path/ke/file.jpg"</code></pre>

        <h2>Contoh — JavaScript (fetch)</h2>
        <pre><code>const form = new FormData();
form.append('file', fileInput.files[0]);

const res = await fetch('<%= apiUrl %>', {
  method: 'POST',
  body: form,
});
const data = await res.json();
console.log(data.url);</code></pre>

        <h2>Contoh — Python (requests)</h2>
        <pre><code>import requests

with open('file.jpg', 'rb') as f:
    res = requests.post(
        '<%= apiUrl %>',
        files={'file': f},
    )

print(res.json()['url'])</code></pre>

        <h2>Contoh — Node.js (fetch)</h2>
        <pre><code>import { openAsBlob } from 'node:fs';

const form = new FormData();
form.append('file', await openAsBlob('file.jpg'), 'file.jpg');

const res = await fetch('<%= apiUrl %>', { method: 'POST', body: form });
const data = await res.json();
console.log(data.url);</code></pre>

        <h2>Respons Berhasil (200)</h2>
        <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "message": "File berhasil diunggah.",
  "filename": "a1b2c3d4.jpg",
  "url": "<%= apiUrl.replace(/\/api$/, '') %>/uploads/temp/a1b2c3d4.jpg",
  "type": "temporary",
  "expires_in": 3600
}</code></pre>

        <h2>Respons Gagal</h2>
        <pre><code>{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Ukuran file terlalu besar. Maksimal 50MB."
}</code></pre>
        <p>Kode status yang mungkin: <code>400</code> (request salah), <code>405</code> (metode bukan POST), <code>413</code> (file terlalu besar), <code>500</code> (gagal simpan).</p>

        <a href="/" class="btn-home">← Kembali ke Beranda</a>
